 var h='<h2 style="margin:6px 0">Fitness</h2><p class="small muted">Coaches build it. Technique first, never to failure, no maximum lifts. Fitness lives inside the session where it can, short and sharp, and counts towards the ten to twelve minutes of uncontested work.</p>';
